WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:02.920
Hello

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.460
Hello

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.460
Hello?

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:05.960
Hello?

00:00:06.220 --> 00:00:07.840
Um..? Hello?

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:08.400
Um..? Hello?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.400
What's going on? Where am I?

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:11.760
I think you're dead

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.740
What do you mean?

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.740
Like you died as in no longer alive

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.480
I was literally just driving home from work everything was fine

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.040
Yeah! and then you died, car accident I think

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.820
But I.. I don't remember anything

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.040
Yeah I think that's typically how death works

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.895
is this like a

00:00:25.895 --> 00:00:27.200
a prank or something or a dream maybe?

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.600
That'd be kind of a weird prank

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.500
to knock you unconscious and then wake you up

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.200
in some weird, empty, white room with no doors or windows

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.000
don't you think?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.700
I guess it's sort of like a dream though, but... no

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:37.800
You're definitely just dead

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.400
Wait so who are you? Are, are you God?

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.000
(suppressed laughter) I wish but... no.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:47.200
I'm you. Kind of. I'm at least who you thought you were.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.600
You know, the voice you've had in your head since you were a little kid

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:52.000
when you started to understand language and all that

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.600
That's me. Or... you

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.700
Or technically just your brain,

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.600
or really just the part of your brain you attached "you" to

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.500
so you could have a sense of self.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.000
Either way, it's all just semantics.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.600
Probably just don't recognize me on account of

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:05.600
you know, being dead

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.600
and all the chemicals in your brain are being flushed out

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:09.600
and I'm sure that's making things kind of confusing

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:10.125
but, I'm still here

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.475
at least for a tiny bit longer

00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:14.355
and then what?

00:01:14.775 --> 00:01:15.775
Good question.

00:01:16.305 --> 00:01:17.715
Okay, and?

00:01:18.095 --> 00:01:21.900
I have no idea. I'm you, remember? What you know I know and, vice versa.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.355
All I know is I'm here for right now

00:01:24.355 --> 00:01:26.300
and based on what I've heard about dying

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.500
you're about to see your whole life pass as it gets drained out of you.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.100
You're going to see it for what it really was, objectively.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.465
Free from the pressures of actually being there.  Free from your ego.

00:01:35.465 --> 00:01:38.215
Free from me. It's going to be intense.

00:01:38.715 --> 00:01:40.605
Okay, wh- when is this going to happen?

00:01:41.100 --> 00:01:41.600
Now.

00:01:42.775 --> 00:01:44.700
[Same voice overlapping itself unintelligibly]

00:01:45.735 --> 00:01:49.000
-They loved you and trusted you. 
-Even though you loved Sarah. 
-You drank too much.
[Continued unintelligible sentences]

00:01:49.085 --> 00:01:50.020
[Continued]

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:52.065
[Continued]
-You took too long so she moved on.

00:01:52.065 --> 00:01:55.145
[Continued]
-You worked really hard but gave up a third of your life for a company that 
-made you feel scared all the time

00:01:55.345 --> 00:02:00.300
[Continued]
-You never really [untintelliglbe] stood up for yourself
-You rushed into a marriage not because you found the right person
-You always wanted to stop

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:04.500
[Continued]
-time
-China
-have more time 
-have more time
-sail and write a book

00:02:04.600 --> 00:02:05.600
So you never did.

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:06.825
(sigh)

00:02:06.825 --> 00:02:08.500
Okay. It's over now.

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:12.700
Makes so much sense. I g- I get it. I know exactly where I went wrong

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:13.735
and what to do differently now.

00:02:13.735 --> 00:02:16.805
I'm going to take time to reconnect with friends and not let new friendships fizzle out

00:02:16.805 --> 00:02:19.000
just 'cause of laziness. I'm going to be nicer and more understanding

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.500
instead of being so impatient and reserved.

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:24.325
I'm going to be more attentive and caring to my wife and not always need to be right when we argue but

00:02:24.325 --> 00:02:25.655
actually care about resolving the issue.

00:02:25.655 --> 00:02:27.500
I'm going to forgive my parents and ask them to forgive me.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.200
I'm going to forgive myself.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.700
I'm going to spend time towards myself.

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:30.945
I'm going to be healthier, eat better,

00:02:30.945 --> 00:02:34.400
exercise, feel good, and not procrastinate on things I want to see and experience.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.400
I'm going to take chances on the things that matter to me.

00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:39.095
I'm gonna actually be myself and like myself instead of always hiding it

00:02:39.095 --> 00:02:40.000
and feeling bad about it.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:41.300
I'm gonna laugh more and worry less.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:43.500
I'm not gonna let little things ruin entire days anymore.

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:47.495
I'm gonna enjoy life for what it is and not be so serious and worried and sad and anxious all the time

00:02:47.495 --> 00:02:48.700
for no good reason. I'm going to-

00:02:48.700 --> 00:02:50.525
Whoa whoa whoa whoa. No.

00:02:50.525 --> 00:02:53.300
You won't. You won't do any of that. You're dead.

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:54.885
Remember? That was it.

00:02:55.265 --> 00:02:57.600
Now it's about to be gone forever.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:58.900
I'm about to be gone forever.

